Job Title: AI/ML Engineer – Fresher

Location: Kharadi, Pune
Experience: Fresher / 0–1 Years
Employment Type: Full-Time (Internship-to-Hire)
Internship Duration: 3- 6 Months (Stipend - 10k)
CTC Post Confirmation : 3-4 LPA
Note : The shortlisted candidate will receive an invitation mail for the virtual drive

About the Role:
We are looking for a passionate and motivated AI/ML Fresher to join our growing team. As an entry-level AI/ML Engineer, you will be working on real-world machine learning and data-driven projects under the guidance of senior team members. This is an excellent opportunity to build your career in artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data science.

Key Responsibilities:
Assist in building and deploying machine learning models.
Collect, clean, and preprocess data from various sources.
Work with Python and ML frameworks like TensorFlow, PyTorch, or Scikit-learn.
Support the team in research, experimentation, and model evaluation.
Contribute to documentation and presentations of ML solutions.
Collaborate with software engineers and data teams to integrate models into applications.

Required Skills:-
Good understanding of machine learning concepts and algorithms.
Proficiency in Python and relevant libraries (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn,LLM, OpenCV, Computer Vision, and Gstreamer etc.).
Basic knowledge of deep learning frameworks (TensorFlow, Keras, PyTorch).
Familiarity with data structures and algorithm fundamentals.
Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.
Excellent communication and willingness to learn.

Good to Have:
Academic or personal projects in AI/ML.
Exposure to cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure).
Knowledge of version control systems like Git.

Educational Qualification:
Bachelor’s or Master’s (BE/Btech/MCA/MSC) degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Artificial Intelligence, or a related field.

Why Join Us:
Work on cutting-edge AI projects.
Mentorship and career development opportunities.
A collaborative and innovative work culture.